    "created_at": "2025-11-20T09:27:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-11-20T09:27:43Z",
    "body": "Given that the use case is to have multiple different origins as fallbacks for the same resource you might also have different settings for attributes like `crossorigin`.\n\nA `srcset` attribute on a single `link` element is something I also considered and I do like it. But unsure if it will cover all cases.",
